n:  \nPushing the e-pawn to e5 seizes control of the center, accelerates development potential for the queen and bishop, and creates long-term threats against Black’s camp. It’s a high-impact move consistent with opening principles and maximizes dynamic potential.\n\nAnswer: P: e4-e5"}
